{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02484","headline":"咏花烛 · 褚亮","name":"咏花烛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰迳香风满，梅梁暖日斜。\n言是东方骑，来寻南陌车。\n靥星临夜烛，眉月隐轻纱。\n莫言春稍晚，自有镇开花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}